lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in v4.5.1.stable.official [f62fdbde1], 4.6-dev3 [6fd949a6dc]\n\n### System information\n\nv4.5.1.stable.official [f62fdbde1] - Windows 11 Pro (version 10.0.26200) / macOS Tahoe 26.1 (25B78) - Multi-monitor single-window mode - Forward+ - AMD Ryzen 9800X3D 64GB RAM NVIDIA GeForce 3080 - Apple M4 32GB RAM\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe \"Use Blend\" property gets reset for Custom Audio Playback Tracks when reimporting/reloading GLTF/GLB files.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Open the MRP project\n2. Open `scene.tscn`\n3. Open the Animation tab and verify that the animation has a custom Audio Playback Track and that it's set to \"Don't Use Blend\"\n4. Open the `animated_cube.glb` file and Reimport it\n5. Open the Animation tab and verify that the custom Audio Playback Track now has \"Use Blend\" set\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nI've attached a MRP project. Just follow the reproduction steps above to verify the bug.\n\n[animation-use-blend-bug-mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23433741/animation-use-blend-bug-mrp.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.